{title: Surmayee Ankhiyo Me}
{artist: Yesudas Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Surmayee[Gm]ankhiyo[D]me        nanha[Gm]munna ek[G]sapna[A7]deja[Dm]re
[Dm]Neendiya ki[A]udti[A7]pankhi[A]re        [Dm]Ankhiyo me[A]aaja[Dm]sathi re
[Dm]La ri la ri[A]...o[Dm]lari room        [Dm]La ri la ri[A]...o[Dm]lari room

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Saccha koi sapna deja        [D]Mujhko koi apna deja
[D]Anja[A]na sa..[D]..ma[A]gar        kuchh[Gm]pehcha[D]na sa
[G]Halka fulka[Cmaj7]shabnami        [G]resham se bhi[C7]reshami

{c: Verse 1}
